# Ceiling, not a preference. transformers 5.17.0 added an unconditional
# `output.to(dtype=self.model.dtype)` to the text-to-audio pipeline
# (pipelines/text_to_audio.py:197). For a tokenizer-backed model such as
# VITS that `output` is a BatchEncoding, whose `.to()` takes no dtype, so
# every synthesis raises TypeError. 5.16.1 is the last release without the
# line. Raise the ceiling only once a release fixes it upstream.
